#: ../../source/references/datatypes/_generated/quotes.md:10
msgid ""
"请勿手改；更新内置类型后请重跑生成脚本。列含义与推荐读法见 [清单入口](../index.md)。`acquisition_type` / "
"`table_name` 仅供对照 refill。"
